Yes that's because on un.nethack.nu there are several versions
installed in parallel. If you start a new game, you play with the
newest version. If you load a save game, it starts the same binary
with which you saved it.

So un.nethack.nu can be updated with save/bones-breaking changes
without losing old save games.

